<title>POLAND: BRE changes dividend pay date.</title>
<headline>BRE changes dividend pay date.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Amount (PLN)		    3.0			1.0</p>
<p> Pay				 July 11</p>
<p> Record			    June 19</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Rozwoju Eksportu SA. Earlier the bank said the dividend would be paid on July 7.</p>
